# Loop Timing Witness — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version or
  DOI exists yet; cite the commit you inspected.
type: software
title: Loop Timing Witness
abstract: >-
  Measurement instrument, in design, for hardware-timestamped latency,
  deadline, fault and energy evidence of real-time control loops and fabric
  accelerators on PolarFire SoC. The repository is architecture-only: it holds
  the measurement contracts, the boundary, the measurement protocol and the
  validation tooling, with no implemented instrument and no measured result.
